OL,3,GNEWSASurrey council backs decision
OL,4,Aagainst Ulez signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FTfL said people outside London were
OL,7,Fbenefiting from cleaner air and that
OL,8,Fmoney from fines was being used to
OL,9,Fimprove its public transport network,
OL,10,Fwhich stretched into Surrey.
